<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>
Quantitative comparison on Droid and our Franka Panda. Green rows denote methods without wrist-view input, yellow rows require a wrist-view first frame, and red highlights our method.
Our method achieves the best performance across all metrics without first-frame guidance.
</figcaption>
